    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d468-a1">

                <pb facs="0485" n="1219" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1219"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Messrs. E. Atkins &amp; Co.
                        to Mr. Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Boston, Mass.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-01-01"><hi rendition="#italic">January 1,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir</hi>: We are informed through confidential
                    but reliable source that it is the intention of the Cuban agents in New York to
                    destroy the buildings and machinery at our estate, Soledad, situated near
                    Cienfuegos, Cuba.</p>
                <p>We beg to lay this information before the State Department, with the suggestion
                    that the same be transmitted through the Spanish minister to the authorities in
                    Cuba, in order that they may be promptly advised and prepared to guard against a
                    possible attack by the insurgents.</p>
                <p>We remain, etc.</p>
                <closer><hi rendition="#small-caps">E. Atkins</hi> &amp; Co.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
